          <p class="essay-coda">
            <em>Related: <a href="/blog/scoring-methodology">How Commit Scores npm Packages: The Methodology</a> — the reasoning behind the weights. <a href="/blog/npm-audit-zero-vulnerabilities">Why npm audit Returns Zero Vulnerabilities for the Most Dangerous Packages</a> — where each tool fits in the stack. <a href="/blog/two-types-npm-attacks">Two Types of npm Supply Chain Attack</a> — what each tool actually covers.</em>
          </p>

